{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_title", "source_sha256": "7f720ed04840a69ddf982bc901d8c023535268a41de82d22b0161a5041de1eda", "ja": "プラネタリウムをせーふく！", "zh": "征服天文馆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a3333e955273456102431ff4772db543bc0c7dddddea53ad0086595ef3841447", "ja": "プラネタリウムでのライブに出演中の、\n『ピコピコプラネッツ』の4人。MCの質問\nコーナーでは、無邪気な質問の数々に真剣な\n答えを返し、みんなのハートを掴む。やがて\n会場はせーふく！　されてしまうのだった。", "zh": "正在天文馆举办演出的『ピコピコプラネッツ』的4名成员。在MC提问\n环节中，她们认真回答一个个天真无邪的问题，牢牢抓住大家的心。最终，\n整个会场就这样被彻底“征服”了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe1fc2c4f8ee70189d964ba0ace6219d4cca0af4a8403313bf83544104638127", "ja": "お友達のみんなー！　あたしたち\n『ピコピコプラネッツ』の歌、どうだったー？", "zh": "朋友们——！我们『ピコ皮可行星』的歌，大家觉得怎么样——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1001_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "7e06ed94735d5b7902a86e9bc0d120461f9c713344a846b7f68330028118a098", "ja": "たのしかったー！", "zh": "好开心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "e6ecb171d9221b013f6809b8c3b9cae7b031c7a52cdbe23acfca0c1887850799", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！　わたしたちも、\nみんなといっしょに歌えて、すっごく楽しいです♪", "zh": "哇，非常感谢！能和大家一起唱歌，\n我们也觉得特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "44b4ac6394ff3c873d0caba79df5821b87cf2837c11ba584d79b93e8c42b275b", "ja": "くふふ、プラネタリウムライブって楽しいね！\nたまき、ずっとわくわくしっぱなしだぞ～！", "zh": "咕呼呼，天文馆演唱会真开心呀！\n环一直都兴奋得停不下来哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "f7db173d2e35acd6147ebc896ad7aeabbdc057195723a84ba26e3e0386216e51", "ja": "このあとも杏奈たちと行く星空の旅、\nビビッと楽しんでいってねー！！", "zh": "接下来也要和杏奈她们一起，尽情享受这段心动不已的星空之旅哦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1005_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "b0577d8d745607a5ea9b786bb21358d100f64d4240438a9fd152d4cfa36c214b", "ja": "はーーーーーい！！！", "zh": "好——————！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "2f9ed309fee296e54fc4167e2e823231b1027afe3252f34fe3dd05ac065266f0", "ja": "えへへ、それじゃあ次の曲……へ行く前に、\nここらでひと息、つこうかねぇ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，那么在进入下一首歌……之前，\n先在这里歇口气吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "47f3a2303c98f65a41f7cd5b114812efceacd32120a3021abefeabdc615bc8f2", "ja": "それではここで、コーナーに行きたいと思います！\nせーの！", "zh": "那么接下来，我们要进入下一个环节了！\n一、二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "40937afdc76569b82aad509561665c16ddb93f925e1c5f1979be838bed156261", "ja": "『おしえて！　ピコピコプラネッツ☆』～！", "zh": "《请告诉我！噼波噼波行星☆》～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
