{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "40937afdc76569b82aad509561665c16ddb93f925e1c5f1979be838bed156261", "ja": "『おしえて！　ピコピコプラネッツ☆』～！", "zh": "《请告诉我！噼波噼波行星☆》～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "40937afdc76569b82aad509561665c16ddb93f925e1c5f1979be838bed156261", "ja": "『おしえて！　ピコピコプラネッツ☆』～！", "zh": "《请告诉我！噼波噼波行星☆》～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "10aa49b15ca6101bb567dc74dd6991ce4ed0d83e34f556df61ccebc042b19e27", "ja": "このコーナーでは、事前にみんなからもらった質問に、\n杏奈たちミリオン星人がビビッとお答えしちゃうよ！", "zh": "在这个环节，我们会由杏奈她们这些百万星人，闪亮亮地回答大家事先提出的问题哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "5c49035871e9b0fb809679647d9f446d2f55ef4a740a4b1d7e2928fa759669f7", "ja": "それじゃ、最初の質問に行くねぇ。\n星梨花ちゃん、お願いします。", "zh": "那么，我们来回答第一个问题吧。\n星梨花，拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e1f447e087b6c6e2094e7289c29149cde19306796ab5290cfc06aa979f25161c", "ja": "はい！　えっと……「プラネタリウムは、とっても\nきれいだけど眠くなります。どうしたらいいですか？」", "zh": "好的！那个……“天文馆虽然非常漂亮，但会让人犯困。该怎么办才好呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "6c0156e4270715e36053762ca3de13eaa7cc6abe126c5f2661e4731a3c64529b", "ja": "うーん、これは困りましたね。\nミリオン星人のみんなは、どう思いますか？", "zh": "嗯……这可难办了。\n百万星人们，你们觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "d444cc794fbde53ea45281c0a549ad057d212dc38db84ae68055474433da1ad5", "ja": "たまきも、眠くなるぞ～。暗いし、静かだし、\n椅子がフカフカで……だから、気持ちがわかる！", "zh": "环也开始犯困了～又暗又安静，椅子还软乎乎的……所以，我能理解你的感受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "3b7eaa1de38369c174386b05328983e9b7d189a1bc72780977abf1c7d10d044b", "ja": "そうだねぇ……眠くなってしまったならば、\nちょっこしお昼寝してしまうのは、どうだべか？", "zh": "是啊……要是困了的话，稍微睡个午觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "47d0f80f585a1fd86c0aabb4aeeb1693f105b17fca2db6b38a8282de812042ae", "ja": "えっ、寝ちゃうんですか？　でも、せっかくの\nプラネタリウムなのに……いいんでしょうか？", "zh": "咦，要睡着了吗？可是，难得来一次天文馆……这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "db7d7e9110e90d4baa764cf6c344fcedda333e0b1d599c09ad7268ae1bae7f08", "ja": "うん。だって、きれいな星を見上げながら寝たら、\n気持ちいいだろうからねぇ。いいんでないかい？", "zh": "嗯。因为一边仰望美丽的星星一边睡觉，肯定会很舒服吧。这样不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "065d136e6a0b495e58dc6b5a27469ba2b6e16402a2feb63308aef6f498dcdc5d", "ja": "プラネタリウムの楽しみ方はひとつじゃないよね！\nみんなも星空を、自由に楽しんじゃおう！", "zh": "享受天文馆的方式不止一种吧！大家也自由地享受星空吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "6c8b37d6e2f7646feaf81f53d65c1e732748b5d02e82eceb66db600e376a8fe4", "ja": "それじゃ、次の質問はたまきが読むね！\nえーと、「ミリオン星人のみんなに質問です……」", "zh": "那接下来就由环来读问题吧！\n嗯——“想问问百万星人们……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "286247b1f6614563794c8a35752bd957c299cd0ef068ec3292e83129bbbcdcc2", "ja": "「みんなお星さまみたいにキラキラしてかわいいけど、\nどうしたらみんなみたいになれますか？」……だって！", "zh": "“大家都像星星一样闪闪发光，又可爱，怎样才能变得像大家一样呢？”……是这么问的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "111f8f65b54675613103178c6cf95e001391b90c083f8b68ce3a17d0a5fae0c1", "ja": "それなら、簡単だよ！\nお友達のみんなも、アイドルになればいいんだよ♪", "zh": "那很简单呀！\n只要朋友们也成为偶像就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "e9ec198c2a41903fa8cbba13688111fde2abfc29a23a64edb72490a4d670c3c7", "ja": "そうですね！　アイドルになったら、\nたくさんキラキラできて、楽しいと思います！", "zh": "是啊！成为偶像之后，就能闪闪发光，我觉得一定会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "80a22032f35a22a0fbe4d1b9383f4678af31fff86f33adb2426b8eabb8f0bedf", "ja": "それでは、『おしえて！　ピコピコプラネッツ☆』\n最後の質問だよ！　ひなたちゃん、お願い！", "zh": "那么，《告诉我吧！噼里啪啦行星☆》最后一个问题！小日向，拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a99c64b5ac4d9518b55c8505204b24be59ab14b46e3e7ed759c72138aa94e79", "ja": "はいっ。えっと……「プラネタリウムで、ミリオン星を\n見つけることができません。どこにあるんですか？」", "zh": "好的。呃……“在天文馆里找不到百万星。它在哪里呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "414aa75a88682ebf944d53d16d5d40073f474e4734d8cb8196e4172683aa5d8d", "ja": "ミリオン星の場所は……地球を出て、ひとつめの\n角を曲がって……うう、なんて言ったらいいんだべか？", "zh": "米莉恩星的位置嘛……离开地球后，在第一个路口拐弯……呜呜，该怎么说才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ed2f659a697170368e1f3a77f9be0ca32fd5971188670c4b608970468b05ef3", "ja": "そうそう！　あのね、ミリオン星はとっても遠いから、\nプラネタリウムには映らないんだ！　残念だけど……。", "zh": "对对！那个啊，百万星离这里非常遥远，所以天文馆里放不出来！虽然有点遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "4214baed966bdfca3b20de8a601f3f1808bc11cc787a181128961304db8befc6", "ja": "ミリオン星って、すっごく遠くにある星なんだ！\nだから、移動もすーっごく大変なんだぞ～。", "zh": "百万星是一颗非常非常遥远的星星！\n所以，移动起来也非常非常辛苦哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "8ed521609c270ba62d74080fd04a6747e69d0af6c50f9cdf533da4b432b55dce", "ja": "たまきたちミリオン星人は、スペースこぶん号っていう\n宇宙船で移動してるんだ。みんなも知ってるよね？", "zh": "我们这些百万星人，都是乘坐名叫宇宙小弟号的宇宙飞船移动的。大家也都知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1031_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "8b1df2ef833cbbf1c432f1fd85a656bb4c8d8f873f012b5dcbdbfc438db18aab", "ja": "知ってるー！", "zh": "我知道——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_011_pp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_011_pp_01_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "c13f28592924a310f672150ece8558d0c46a5ff7edacb84cd0c0c49710192ecc", "ja": "あたしたち、こぶんちゃんには\nいっつもお世話になってるからねえ。", "zh": "我们一直都受小跟班照顾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
